{"seq":3,"slug":"dealer-recruitment-pipeline-funnel","title":"经销商招募管道：线索分层、尽调淘汰与签约转化漏斗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/export-franchise-dealer-network-expansion/market-prioritization-territory/dealer-recruitment-pipeline-funnel","wordCount":3201,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"经销商招募管道-线索分层-尽调淘汰与签约转化漏斗\">经销商招募管道：线索分层、尽调淘汰与签约转化漏斗</h1><p>一个出口品牌选定目标市场之后，真正卡住进度的不是「找不到经销商」，而是「候选名单很长、能签约的很少」。一场行业展会下来能收到几十张名片，本土分销商、代理商、连锁零售商、贸易商混在一起；一年后回头看，真正产生首单的往往只有三到五家。把线索筛成几个可交付的合作方需要一条被显式建模的管道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>经销商招募漏斗的阶段划分要与内部 CRM 阶段严格对齐，否则「转化率」只是口头数字。一条可用的口径把管道分为六段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>来源获取（Sourcing）</strong>——展会、协会名录、平台服务商、转介绍进入的原始名单</li>\n<li><strong>初筛合格（Screened）</strong>——规模、品类、区域匹配的快速筛选</li>\n<li><strong>深度尽调（Diligence）</strong>——主体、财务、廉洁、数据四条并行轨道</li>\n<li><strong>商务谈判（Negotiation）</strong>——意向书、条款清单到正式协议</li>\n<li><strong>签约（Signed）</strong>——合同生效</li>\n<li><strong>激活出首单（Activated）</strong>——首批订货、培训、首单客户</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后一段最容易被漏掉：签下合同不等于获得渠道能力。行业内把「签约但不出货」的伙伴称为僵尸经销商，在很多品类里占签约总量的三成以上。漏斗也不是直线——合规与信用是<strong>并行的否决轨道</strong>，任一条触发红线即出局；把否决做成串行步骤（先谈商务再查背景）会浪费谈判工时，也会让已投入的关系资本绑架判断。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[来源获取 Sourcing&lt;br/&gt;展会/协会/平台/推荐] --&gt; B[初筛 Screened&lt;br/&gt;规模/品类/区域匹配]&#10;  B --&gt; C[评分分层 Scoring&lt;br/&gt;A/B/C 级]&#10;  C --&gt; D{并行否决轨道}&#10;  D --&gt;|主体与制裁| E[合规尽调]&#10;  D --&gt;|财务与信用| F[财务尽调]&#10;  D --&gt;|反贿赂与声誉| G[廉洁尽调]&#10;  E --&gt; H{红线?}&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt;|触发| I[出局并归档]&#10;  H --&gt;|通过| J[商务谈判&lt;br/&gt;条款/独家/首单]&#10;  J --&gt; K[签约 Signed]&#10;  K --&gt; L[激活 Activated&lt;br/&gt;首批/培训/首单]&#10;  L --&gt;|未激活| M[降级为观察伙伴]&#10;  L --&gt;|激活| N[进入常态化返单]\">flowchart TD\n  A[来源获取 Sourcing&lt;br/&gt;展会/协会/平台/推荐] --&gt; B[初筛 Screened&lt;br/&gt;规模/品类/区域匹配]\n  B --&gt; C[评分分层 Scoring&lt;br/&gt;A/B/C 级]\n  C --&gt; D{并行否决轨道}\n  D --&gt;|主体与制裁| E[合规尽调]\n  D --&gt;|财务与信用| F[财务尽调]\n  D --&gt;|反贿赂与声誉| G[廉洁尽调]\n  E --&gt; H{红线?}\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt;|触发| I[出局并归档]\n  H --&gt;|通过| J[商务谈判&lt;br/&gt;条款/独家/首单]\n  J --&gt; K[签约 Signed]\n  K --&gt; L[激活 Activated&lt;br/&gt;首批/培训/首单]\n  L --&gt;|未激活| M[降级为观察伙伴]\n  L --&gt;|激活| N[进入常态化返单]</pre><p>分层与转化必须用同一套计数。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 段进入数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该段转化率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_k = N_{k+1}/N_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，端到端转化率是各段之积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\prod_{k=1}^{n} c_k = \\frac{N_{n+1}}{N_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由此可得<strong>管道覆盖比</strong>：若当期需签约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 家、整体转化率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，则进入初筛的合格线索数至少要达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≳</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_1 \\gtrsim Q / C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。若整体转化率是 5%，要签 4 家就需至少 80 条合格线索——团队排不出这个数时会把「签不下」误判成「谈判技巧不行」，实际是前段供给不足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线索分层-从原始名单到合格候选\">线索分层：从原始名单到合格候选</h2><p>来源渠道决定线索质量结构。展会名片、协会名录、头部进口商榜单、平台品牌代理服务商、已有经销商转介绍，这五类来源的意向强度依次不同：展会是弱意向高覆盖，转介绍是强意向低覆盖。把两类混在一个池子里平均用力，会拖慢转介绍这类高价值线索的响应。分层的锚点是<strong>理想伙伴画像（IPP）</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>准则</th>\n<th>具体观测项</th>\n<th>数据获取方式</th>\n<th>权重区间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>市场覆盖</td>\n<td>现有终端客户数、覆盖城市/区域、销售员规模</td>\n<td>访谈、门店走访、第三方零售审计</td>\n<td>20%–30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类与渠道契合</td>\n<td>在售品类重叠度、货架位置、目标客群一致性</td>\n<td>产品目录、门店陈列核查</td>\n<td>15%–25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务偿付能力</td>\n<td>注册资本、审计报表、银行授信、账期诉求</td>\n<td>审计报告、银行资信证明、信用报告</td>\n<td>20%–30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物流与售后能力</td>\n<td>仓储面积、冷链/危险品资质、退换货处理</td>\n<td>实地走访、资质文件</td>\n<td>10%–20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规与声誉</td>\n<td>诉讼记录、制裁名单命中、负面舆情</td>\n<td>尽调数据库、公开判决检索</td>\n<td>一票否决项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>战略投入意愿</td>\n<td>是否接受最低采购额、品牌专区、培训投入</td>\n<td>谈判意向书、同类品牌合作历史</td>\n<td>10%–20%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>打分后按总分与红线情况分为 A/B/C 三级：A 级立即进入尽调与高层会面，B 级保持季度触达，C 级归档为长期观察。分级是为了<strong>分配响应与管理资源</strong>——这与<a href=\"market-entry-prioritization-scoring\">市场进入优先级评分模型</a>同属多准则决策，区别只在评分对象从「国家」换成了「渠道伙伴」。</p>\n<p>响应速度是独立成立的一条杠杆。Oldroyd、McElheran 与 Elkington 在《哈佛商业评论》2011 年 3 月刊的研究（<em>The Short Life of Online Sales Leads</em>）发现，收到线索后一小时内建立联系的企业，与决策者发生有意义对话的概率显著高于拖延到 24 小时以上者。跨国招募中时差把「一小时响应」拉成「隔夜响应」，按目标市场时区排班首次响应责任人因此比增加销售人数更划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"尽调淘汰-把-看起来合适-筛成-能承担风险\">尽调淘汰：把「看起来合适」筛成「能承担风险」</h2><p>尽调不是填表，而是一组相互独立的否决测试。任何候选伙伴在写入合同前都要通过四条轨道。</p>\n<p><strong>主体与股权轨道</strong>解决「我到底在和谁签约」，需穿透到最终受益所有人（UBO），核对注册主体、股东结构与代持/空壳特征。欧盟第 5 号反洗钱指令（Directive (EU) 2018/843）将受益所有人门槛设为持股 25% 以上，已成跨国商业核验的通用参照。制裁筛查须覆盖美国 OFAC 特别指定国民名单（SDN）、美国商务部 BIS 实体清单（Entity List）、欧盟与联合国制裁名单，并注意 OFAC 的<strong>50% 规则</strong>：被制裁主体直接或间接持股 50% 及以上的实体自动受限，即便它自身不在名单上——只做名称匹配、不做股权穿透的流程会系统性漏掉这类对象。</p>\n<p><strong>财务与信用轨道</strong>解决「它能不能按期付款」。除审计报表与银行资信证明外，贸易信用领域有两类通用信号：邓白氏（Dun &amp; Bradstreet）的 PAYDEX 付款指数（80 分为按期付款基准）与 Failure Score；以及财务困境判别模型，Altman Z-Score 是最经久的版本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.2</mn><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1.4</mn><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3.3</mn><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.6</mn><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1.0</mn><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z = 1.2X_1 + 1.4X_2 + 3.3X_3 + 0.6X_4 + 1.0X_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为营运资本/总资产、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为留存收益/总资产、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为息税前利润/总资产、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为股权市值/总负债、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为销售额/总资产。经典阈值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2.99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z &gt; 2.99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.99</span></span></span></span></span> 归为安全区、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.81</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z &lt; 1.81</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.81</span></span></span></span></span> 归为困境区；对新兴市场非上市贸易商，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 需用账面权益近似，结果只能作排序参考。决定合作结构的往往不是 Z 值本身，而是账期诉求与预付款、信用证（L/C）或信用保险的组合。</p>\n<p><strong>反贿赂与廉洁轨道</strong>解决「我会不会为对方的支付行为承担法律责任」。美国《反海外腐败法》（FCPA）通过账簿记录条款（15 U.S.C. §78m(b)(2)(B)）要求发行人对其第三方代理人的支付负责，美国司法部与证交会合编的《FCPA 资源指南》（第二版，2020 年 7 月）把「风险为本的第三方尽职调查」列为有效合规计划的核心要素。英国《2010 年反贿赂法》第 7 条则创设「未能防止贿赂」罪。</p>\n<p><strong>数据与知识产权轨道</strong>解决「签约会不会引入新的法律暴露」。若经销商接触欧洲数据主体的个人信息（终端客户名单、售后记录），双方构成 GDPR 意义上的控制者—处理者关系，须签署符合第 28 条的处理协议并限定目的。商标与渠道上要核查目标市场是否已有被抢注的商标、对方是否同时经营平行进口（灰市）货源；若拟授予排他性，还要评估份额门槛——欧盟 2022 年《纵向协议集体豁免条例》（Commission Regulation (EU) 2022/720）将排他分销与排他客户划分的豁免上限设为相关市场份额 30%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"签约转化-从尽调到签约的最后一公里\">签约转化：从尽调到签约的最后一公里</h2><p>尽调通过后，漏斗进入最容易拖延的一段。把谈判拆成「意向书—条款清单—正式协议」三级可显著降低悬置率：意向书（LOI）锁定意愿与排他谈判期，条款清单（Term Sheet）固定首年采购额、价格体系、区域、独家与否与支持义务，正式协议才处理违约、终止、争议解决等长尾。</p>\n<p>合同文本上，国际商会（ICC）的《ICC 国际特许经营合同范本》与《ICC 分销合同范本》（后者在 ICC 商务解决方案目录中定价 49 欧元）被广泛用作谈判起点，其价值在于提供中立、平衡的条款结构，降低不同法域下律师各自起草的解释成本。若合作模式是特许经营而非分销，还需叠加目标市场的强制披露义务：美国联邦贸易委员会《特许经营规则》编在 16 CFR Part 436（72 FR 15544，2007 年 3 月 30 日），要求特许人在签署或支付前至少提前 14 天交付特许经营披露文件（FDD，见 §436.2），其中第 19 项（Item 19）只有在满足条件时才允许作出财务业绩陈述；中国 2007 年《商业特许经营管理条例》则确立了「两店一年」门槛、强制备案与签约前信息披露义务。这些义务按模式触发：分销协议通常不适用，但一旦协议实质授予商标使用权与经营体系就可能被重新定性——这是<a href=\"../channel-model-legal-entity/franchise-vs-distributor-agent-model\">渠道模式与法律主体选择</a>需要提前定的问题。</p>\n<p>一条有效的去风险做法是<strong>里程碑式独家（Earned Exclusivity）</strong>：不在首次签约时授予整片区域排他权，而以首年采购额、上架门店数、市场投入等里程碑为条件逐级解锁，未达标自动降级为非独家。它把「要不要给独家」这个一次性高风险决策拆成若干次可观测、可回退的小决策，也天然规避了排他条款触碰竞争法门槛的风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"管道运营与季度复盘\">管道运营与季度复盘</h2><p>漏斗要变成可管理的系统，前提是每个阶段有进入/退出标准、责任人与停留时长上限。停留时长（Aging）比阶段总数更能预警问题：候选伙伴在「商务谈判」停留超过 90 天而未推进，多半已名存实亡——中东与拉美的一次商谈周期常被拉长，但超过两个季度仍未定档，就应重新分级或移出在管池。</p>\n<p>管道价值必须按概率加权，而非把潜在合同额相加。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 项机会名义金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、其阶段历史转化率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则加权管道价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} V_i \\cdot p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个数字用于横向对齐产能：当中东区加权管道是 40 万美元、东南亚区是 12 万美元，而两区投入人力相当时，资源错配就暴露了。单家签约经销商的获取成本（CPA）同样要入账，且分母是「激活数」而非「签约数」——用签约数做分母会低估成本，因为僵尸经销商吞噬了投入却不产出。</p>\n<p>买方侧还有一条规律：Gartner 对 B2B 采购旅程的跟踪显示，采购方由六到十余名利益相关者组成的决策单元共同决策，供应商面对面沟通时间仅占买方决策总时间的一成多，相当比例的商机最终以「不做决定」而非「输给竞争者」收场。对渠道招募的启示是：拖延与悬置本身就是主要流失形态，把「推动对方内部形成决策」写进运营动作（可转发的评估材料、决策人到访工厂、用里程碑方案降低一次性承诺）比反复催价更有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>经销商招募管道的本质是把渠道开发从关系驱动变成流程驱动：用 IPP 与 A/B/C 分层的同一口径筛选线索，用主体、财务、廉洁、数据四条并行否决轨道做尽调，用「意向书—条款清单—正式协议」三级谈判与里程碑式独家控制签约风险，再用加权管道价值、停留时长、CPA 持续运营。每季度复盘固定回答四个问题：各阶段转化率是升是降；哪一阶段停留时长异常；加权管道价值能否覆盖当季签约目标；出局线索里红线触发与商务谈崩各占多少。若出局集中在前者，说明合规前置筛选没有生效，问题在流程入口而非谈判桌。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"经销商招募管道：线索分层、尽调淘汰与签约转化漏斗","id":"经销商招募管道-线索分层-尽调淘汰与签约转化漏斗"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"线索分层：从原始名单到合格候选","id":"线索分层-从原始名单到合格候选"},{"level":2,"text":"尽调淘汰：把「看起来合适」筛成「能承担风险」","id":"尽调淘汰-把-看起来合适-筛成-能承担风险"},{"level":2,"text":"签约转化：从尽调到签约的最后一公里","id":"签约转化-从尽调到签约的最后一公里"},{"level":2,"text":"管道运营与季度复盘","id":"管道运营与季度复盘"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"区域专营权与 carve-out 边界：独家范围、渠道冲突与电商自营保留","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/export-franchise-dealer-network-expansion/market-prioritization-territory/territory-exclusivity-carve-out"},"next":{"title":"经销商入驻与激活清单：资质核验、账期授信与首单落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/export-franchise-dealer-network-expansion/partner-onboarding-enablement/dealer-onboarding-activation-checklist"}}